     "object": "o_nechtechu_raglav",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "אלא לתנא דבי רבי ישמעאל, דאמר שמונה עשרה טרפות ותו ליכא -- והא איכא בהמה שנחתכו רגליה מן הארכובה ולמעלה טרפה?",
     "against": "p_tdbry_shmona_esre",
     "state": "answered"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_tana_veshayar",
     "gloss_en": "granted for our tanna: what he taught he taught, and what he omitted comes under 'this is the principle'"
    }
   ]
  },
  "1": {
   "segId": "Chullin.42b.2",
   "sugya": "chullin_42a_remez_litereifa",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "objection_answer",
     "object": "a_kirshba_kesheira",
     "gloss_en": "אלא סבר לה כרבי שמעון בן אלעזר, דאמר כשרה היא (= p_tdbry_kirshba_kesheira; its first form, 'it can be cauterized and live', fell at 42b.2; this form is itself given up at 43a.1)",
     "answers": "o_nechtechu_raglav",
     "restores": "p_tdbry_shmona_esre"
    },
    {
     "type": "objection",
     "object": "o_lichvot_tereifa_chaya",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "אף על גב דיכולה ליכוות ולחיות, למאן קאמר? לתנא דבי רבי ישמעאל -- תנא דבי רבי ישמעאל טרפה חיה סבירא ליה! -- whether it can live is beside the point for one who holds a tereifa lives",
     "against": "p_tdbry_kirshba_lichvot",
     "state": "live"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_rshba_kesheira",
     "gloss_en": "R' Shimon ben Elazar: it is fit"
    }
   ]
  },
